            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Moc - Estella Place",
            "review_text": "Roving43623301291\n2 contributions\n0\nVietnamese Broken rice\nAug 2025 • Solo\nI had lunch at CTM in Estella and it was a delightful experience. The restaurant has a bright and elegant design, making it a comfortable spot for both families and friends. The grilled pork was tender with a smoky flavor, and the broken rice was perfectly cooked. I also liked the variety of side dishes that complemented the main plate very well. The service was quick and professional, and the prices were good value for the quality. I would definitely recommend this place if you want authentic Vietnamese broken rice in a nice setting.\nRead more\nWritten October 3, 2025",
